 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Large Movements in Dynamic Scenes:** If the movement between consecutive frames is large, occluded regions may get stuck in the previous frame's SDF. The method addresses this by predicting a global transformation to align frames [S1].
-*   **Precision:** The method aims to reduce memory footprint and computational cost, which may have implications for precision, but specific details are not provided [S1].
